   "source": [
    "### How is the performance evolving for the elite (e.g. Top 3) in comarison to the second/third row (e.g. Top 10/20/30) over the years\n",
    "\n",
    "**NOTE**: Not more than top 30 to have always the same amount of data for comparability\n",
    "\n",
    "1. The top-X performances are taken for every discipline x gender x age group seperatly -> calculation of mean and standard deviation for every group\n",
    "\n",
    "2. We first look at all disciplines/Gender/Age Group together -> mean aggregated over all groups per year\n",
    "\n",
    "3. Plotting the difference of mean performance to the first recorded year, e.g. 2001 -> over 1.0 -> increase in peformance, under 1.0 -> decrease in performance "
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 67,
   "id": "683f7226",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
